  "modelName": "Qwen3-Coder-Next-GGUF",
  "prompt": "You are an expert frontend developer and UI designer. Create a single-page, standalone HTML document containing a complex, animated \"System Monitor\" dashboard with a heavy Cyberpunk / Sci-Fi aesthetic.\n\nSTRICT TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS:\n1. ALL HTML, CSS, and JavaScript must be contained within a single file. Do not import external libraries (no React, no Tailwind, no external CSS). You may use Google Fonts (e.g., 'Share Tech Mono' or 'Orbitron').\n2. Do NOT output markdown code blocks (```html). Start exactly with <!DOCTYPE html> and end with </html>.\n\nLAYOUT SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The layout must feature a permanent, fixed sidebar on the left side (approx 250px wide) containing a futuristic user profile and at least four functional-looking navigation buttons.\n2. The main content area must utilize a responsive CSS Grid structure to display at least three distinct data panels.\n\nAESTHETIC & GEOMETRIC SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The color palette must be dark mode: deep black backgrounds (#050505), with neon cyan, hot magenta, and toxic green accents.\n2. To achieve a seamless Sci-Fi look, the primary data panels must feature an inward-curving top corner (a custom border-radius or clip-path cut-out), giving it a highly structured, non-boxy appearance.\n3. Include a subtle, semi-transparent CSS \"scanline\" overlay across the entire viewport to simulate a CRT monitor.\n\nANIMATION & INTERACTIVITY SPECIFICATIONS (JavaScript required):\n1. Glitch Effect: The main dashboard header text must feature a CSS keyframe animation that occasionally \"glitches\" (splitting colors or offsetting text for a split second).\n2. Live Telemetry: One of the grid panels must contain a \"CPU/RAM Load\" bar chart or circular progress indicator. Use JavaScript to randomly update these values and animate the bars/circles every 800 milliseconds.\n3. Terminal Output: Another panel must act as a terminal window. Use JavaScript to automatically append simulated, matrix-style data logs (e.g., \"0x00FF... BYPASSING SECURITY...\") that scroll continuously.\n\nEnsure the final output is visually stunning, responsive, and immediately interactive upon loading.\n",
  "rawOutput": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Cyberpunk System Monitor</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #050505;\n            --neon-cyan: #00f3ff;\n            --neon-magenta: #ff00ff;\n            --neon-green: #0aff00;\n            --panel-bg: #0a0a0a;\n            --border-width: 2px;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--neon-cyan);\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            height: 100vh;\n        }\n\n        /* CRT Scanline Overlay */\n        .scanlines {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            background: linear-gradient(\n                to bottom,\n                rgba(255,255,255,0),\n                rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%,\n                rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 50%,\n                rgba(0,0,0,0.2)\n            );\n            background-size: 100% 4px;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 9999;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n        }\n\n        /* Layout Container */\n        .dashboard-container {\n            display: flex;\n            height: 100vh;\n        }\n\n        /* Sidebar */\n        .sidebar {\n            width: 250px;\n            background-color: #080808;\n            border-right: var(--border-width) solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            padding: 2rem;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 2rem;\n            box-shadow: 5px 0 15px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n                0deg,\n                transparent,\n                transparent 29px,\n                rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.05) 30px\n            );\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .profile {\n            text-align: center;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .profile-avatar {\n            width: 80px;\n            height: 80px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 2px solid var(--neon-magenta);\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, #1a0a1a 0%, #000 100%);\n            margin: 0 auto 1rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--neon-magenta);\n        }\n\n        .profile-avatar::after {\n            content: 'CMD';\n            color: var(--neon-magenta);\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: 900;\n        }\n\n        .profile-name {\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n            color: var(--neon-magenta);\n            text-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--neon-magenta);\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n        }\n\n        .profile-role {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: var(--neon-green);\n        }\n\n        .nav-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn {\n            background: transparent;\n            border: 1px solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            color: var(--neon-cyan);\n            padding: 1rem;\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn:hover {\n            background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.1);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-cyan);\n            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: -100%;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.4), transparent);\n            transition: 0.5s;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn:hover::before {\n            left: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn.active {\n            background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);\n            border-color: var(--neon-magenta);\n            color: var(--neon-magenta);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--neon-magenta);\n        }\n\n        /* Main Content */\n        .main-content {\n            flex: 1;\n            padding: 2rem;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .dashboard-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            padding-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .dashboard-title {\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #fff;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .dashboard-title::before {\n            content: 'SYS_MONITOR_V.9.0';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -20px;\n            left: 0;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: var(--neon-green);\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .system-status {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            color: var(--neon-green);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .status-indicator {\n            width: 12px;\n            height: 12px;\n            background-color: var(--neon-green);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-green);\n            animation: pulse 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        /* Grid Layout */\n        .data-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;\n            gap: 2rem;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .panel {\n            background-color: var(--panel-bg);\n            border: var(--border-width) solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .panel:hover {\n            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .panel::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            height: 4px;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-cyan), var(--neon-magenta), var(--neon-cyan));\n            background-size: 200% 100%;\n            animation: gradientMove 3s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .panel-header {\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            color: #fff;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .panel-icon {\n            color: var(--neon-magenta);\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom Clip-path for inward-curving top corners */\n        .panel-content {\n            position: relative;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -10px;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 30px;\n            background: var(--panel-bg);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -15px;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 25px;\n            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0 / 30% 30% 0 0;\n            background: var(--panel-bg);\n            z-index: 1;\n            border-top: var(--border-width) solid var(--neon-cyan);\n        }\n\n        /* CPU/RAM Panel */\n        .cpu-ram-container {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .metric-group {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .metric-label {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            color: #ccc;\n        }\n\n        .metric-bar-container {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 20px;\n            background-color: #1a1a1a;\n            border: 1px solid #333;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .metric-bar {\n            height: 100%;\n            width: 0%;\n            transition: width 0.8s ease;\n        }\n\n        .cpu-bar {\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-cyan), #00aaff);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-cyan);\n        }\n\n        .ram-bar {\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-magenta), #aa00aa);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-magenta);\n        }\n\n        .circular-gauge {\n            width: 120px;\n            height: 120px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 4px solid var(--neon-green);\n            border-top: 4px solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            position: relative;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin: 1rem auto;\n            animation: spin 3s linear infinite;\n        }\n\n        .circular-gauge::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 100px;\n            height: 100px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 2px dashed var(--neon-magenta);\n            animation: spinReverse 5s linear infinite;\n        }\n\n        .gauge-value {\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            color: #fff;\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n\n        .gauge-label {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: var(--neon-green);\n        }\n\n        /* Terminal Panel */\n        .terminal-window {\n            background-color: #000;\n            border: 1px solid var(--neon-green);\n            padding: 1rem;\n            height: 100%;\n            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: var(--neon-green);\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            position: relative;\n            box-shadow: inset 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n        }\n\n        .terminal-window::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            height: 15px;\n            background: rgba(10, 255, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .terminal-line {\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            padding-left: 10px;\n            border-left: 2px solid var(--neon-green);\n            opacity: 0.9;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-line::before {\n            content: '>';\n            color: var(--neon-cyan);\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .log-bypass {\n            color: var(--neon-magenta);\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .log-success {\n            color: var(--neon-green);\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .log-error {\n            color: #ff3333;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        /* Network Panel */\n        .network-map {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .network-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: 1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .node {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 60px;\n            border: 1px solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: var(--neon-cyan);\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            position: relative;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .node.active {\n            background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-cyan);\n        }\n\n        .node.active::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 1px solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            animation: ripple 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .connections {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 1px;\n            background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n                90deg,\n                var(--neon-cyan),\n                var(--neon-cyan) 5px,\n                transparent 5px,\n                transparent 10px\n            );\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .connections::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -5px;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 1px;\n            background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n                90deg,\n                var(--neon-magenta),\n                var(--neon-magenta) 5px,\n                transparent 5px,\n                transparent 10px\n            );\n            animation: connectionMove 2s infinite linear;\n        }\n\n        /* Animations */\n        @keyframes pulse {\n            0% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1); }\n            50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2); box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-green); }\n            100% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1); }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes gradientMove {\n            0% { background-position: 0% 0%; }\n            50% { background-position: 100% 0%; }\n            100% { background-position: 0% 0%; }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes spin {\n            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes spinReverse {\n            0% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n            100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes ripple {\n            0% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 1; }\n            100% { transform: scale(1.5); opacity: 0; }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes connectionMove {\n            0% { transform: translateX(0); }\n            100% { transform: translateX(100px); }\n        }\n\n        /* Glitch Effect */\n        @keyframes glitch {\n            0% { text-shadow: 2px 0 var(--neon-magenta), -2px 0 var(--neon-cyan); transform: skew(0deg); }\n            10% { text-shadow: -2px 0 var(--neon-magenta), 2px 0 var(--neon-cyan); transform: skew(5deg); }\n            20% { text-shadow: 2px 0 var(--neon-magenta), -2px 0 var(--neon-cyan); transform: skew(-5deg); }\n            30% { text-shadow: 0 0 0 transparent; transform: skew(0deg); }\n            40% { text-shadow: 2px 0 var(--neon-magenta), -2px 0 var(--neon-cyan); transform: skew(3deg); }\n            50% { text-shadow: -2px 0 var(--neon-magenta), 2px 0 var(--neon-cyan); transform: skew(-3deg); }\n            60% { text-shadow: 0 0 0 transparent; transform: skew(0deg); }\n            70% { text-shadow: 2px 0 var(--neon-magenta), -2px 0 var(--neon-cyan); transform: skew(2deg); }\n            80% { text-shadow: -2px 0 var(--neon-magenta), 2px 0 var(--neon-cyan); transform: skew(-2deg); }\n            90% { text-shadow: 0 0 0 transparent; transform: skew(0deg); }\n            100% { text-shadow: 2px 0 var(--neon-magenta), -2px 0 var(--neon-cyan); transform: skew(1deg); }\n        }\n\n        .glitch-text {\n            position: relative;\n            animation: glitch 4s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .glitch-text:hover {\n            animation: glitch 0.2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        /* Responsive Design */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .dashboard-container {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n\n            .sidebar {\n                width: 100%;\n                height: auto;\n                flex-direction: row;\n                flex-wrap: wrap;\n                padding: 1rem;\n                gap: 1rem;\n                border-right: none;\n                border-bottom: var(--border-width) solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            }\n\n            .profile {\n                flex: 1;\n                text-align: left;\n                padding-bottom: 0;\n                border-bottom: none;\n                display: flex;\n                align-items: center;\n                gap: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .profile-avatar {\n                width: 50px;\n                height: 50px;\n                margin: 0;\n            }\n\n            .profile-name {\n                font-size: 1.1rem;\n                margin: 0;\n            }\n\n            .profile-role {\n                font-size: 0.8rem;\n                display: none;\n            }\n\n            .nav-buttons {\n                flex: 1;\n                flex-direction: row;\n                flex-wrap: wrap;\n                gap: 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .nav-btn {\n                padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                flex: 1;\n                min-width: 100px;\n            }\n\n            .data-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                grid-template-rows: auto auto;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"scanlines\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"dashboard-container\">\n        <!-- Sidebar -->\n        <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n            <div class=\"profile\">\n                <div class=\"profile-avatar\"></div>\n                <div class=\"profile-name\">SYSTEM_ADMIN</div>\n                <div class=\"profile-role\">ROOT ACCESS: GRANTED</div>\n            </div>\n            <nav class=\"nav-buttons\">\n                <button class=\"nav-btn active\" onclick=\"switchTab(this, 'dashboard')\">\n                    DASHBOARD\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-btn\" onclick=\"switchTab(this, 'network')\">\n                    NETWORK\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-btn\" onclick=\"switchTab(this, 'security')\">\n                    SECURITY\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-btn\" onclick=\"switchTab(this, 'logs')\">\n                    LOGS\n                </button>\n            </nav>\n            <div class=\"sidebar-footer\">\n                <div style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--neon-green); margin-top: auto;\">\n                    SYSTEM STATUS: ONLINE<br>\n                    UPTIME: 99.99%\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Main Content -->\n        <main class=\"main-content\">\n            <header class=\"dashboard-header\">\n                <h1 class=\"dashboard-title glitch-text\">SYSTEM MONITOR</h1>\n                <div class=\"system-status\">\n                    <div class=\"status-indicator\"></div>\n                    <span>CONNECTION SECURE</span>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"data-grid\">\n                <!-- CPU/RAM Panel -->\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-header\">\n                        <span>CPU & RAM LOAD</span>\n                        <span class=\"panel-icon\">\u26a1</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                        <div class=\"cpu-ram-container\">\n                            <div class=\"metric-group\">\n                                <div class=\"metric-label\">\n                                    <span>CPU Core 1</span>\n                                    <span id=\"cpu1\">12%</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"metric-bar-container\">\n                                    <div class=\"metric-bar cpu-bar\" id=\"cpu1-bar\" style=\"width: 12%\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"metric-group\">\n                                <div class=\"metric-label\">\n                                    <span>CPU Core 2</span>\n                                    <span id=\"cpu2\">25%</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"metric-bar-container\">\n                                    <div class=\"metric-bar cpu-bar\" id=\"cpu2-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"metric-group\">\n                                <div class=\"metric-label\">\n                                    <span>RAM USAGE</span>\n                                    <span id=\"ram\">48%</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"metric-bar-container\">\n                                    <div class=\"metric-bar ram-bar\" id=\"ram-bar\" style=\"width: 48%\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"circular-gauge\">\n                                    <div class=\"gauge-value\" id=\"temp\">45\u00b0C</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"gauge-label\">SYSTEM TEMPERATURE</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Terminal Panel -->\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-header\">\n                        <span>TERMINAL OUTPUT</span>\n                        <span class=\"panel-icon\">\ud83d\udcbb</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                        <div class=\"terminal-window\" id=\"terminal\">\n                            <div class=\"terminal-line\">INITIALIZING SYSTEM MONITOR...</div>\n                            <div class=\"terminal-line\">CONNECTING TO SECURE SERVER... [OK]</div>\n                            <div class=\"terminal-line\">LOADING MODULES: [OK]</div>\n                            <div class=\"terminal-line\">ESTABLISHING SECURE CONNECTION... [OK]</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Network Panel -->\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-header\">\n                        <span>NETWORK TOPOLOGY</span>\n                        <span class=\"panel-icon\">\ud83c\udf10</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                        <div class=\"network-map\">\n                            <div class=\"connections\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"network-grid\">\n                                <div class=\"node active\" id=\"node1\">NODE A</div>\n                                <div class=\"node\" id=\"node2\">NODE B</div>\n                                <div class=\"node\" id=\"node3\">NODE C</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem; text-align: center;\">\n                                <div style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--neon-cyan); margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n                                    TRAFFIC ANALYSIS\n                                </div>\n                                <div style=\"width: 100%; height: 20px; background: #1a1a1a; border: 1px solid #333; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n                                    <div class=\"metric-bar\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-green), #00ff00); width: 0%;\" id=\"traffic-bar\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0.5rem; color: var(--neon-green);\" id=\"traffic-value\">0 MB/s</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- System Info Panel -->\n                <div class=\"panel\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-header\">\n                        <span>SYSTEM DETAILS</span>\n                        <span class=\"panel-icon\">\u2699\ufe0f</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                        <div style=\"padding: 1rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                            <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n                                <span style=\"color: var(--neon-magenta);\">KERNEL VERSION:</span>\n                                <span style=\"color: #fff;\">5.15.0-CYBER</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n                                <span style=\"color: var(--neon-magenta);\">MEMORY:</span>\n                                <span style=\"color: #fff;\">64 TB (PARALLEL)</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n                                <span style=\"color: var(--neon-magenta);\">SECURITY LEVEL:</span>\n                                <span style=\"color: var(--neon-green);\">MAXIMUM</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n                                <span style=\"color: var(--neon-magenta);\">NETWORK:</span>\n                                <span style=\"color: #fff;\">QUANTUM-ENCRYPTED</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\">\n                                <span style=\"color: var(--neon-magenta);\">NEXT MAINTENANCE:</span>\n                                <span style=\"color: #fff;\">00:15:32</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Terminal logs generation\n        const terminal = document.getElementById('terminal');\n        const logMessages = [\n            \"0x00FF3C BYPASSING SECURITY LAYERS...\",\n            \"0x00FF3D FIREWALL DETECTED... ATTEMPTING CRACK...\",\n            \"0x00FF3E FIREWALL BYPASSED SUCCESSFULLY...\",\n            \"0x00FF3F ACCESSING MAINFRAME DATA...\",\n            \"0x00FF40 DATA INTEGRITY CHECK: PASSED...\",\n            \"0x00FF41 ENCRYPTING TRANSMISSION...\",\n            \"0x00FF42 TRANSMISSION COMPLETE...\",\n            \"0x00FF43 SYNCHRONIZING NODES...\",\n            \"0x00FF44 NODE SYNCHRONIZATION: 78% COMPLETE...\",\n            \"0x00FF45 NODE SYNCHRONIZATION: COMPLETE...\",\n            \"0x00FF46 INITIATING SYSTEM DIAGNOSTICS...\",\n            \"0x00FF47 DIAGNOSTICS: ALL SYSTEMS OPERATIONAL...\",\n            \"0x00FF48 SCANNING FOR NETWORK THREATS...\",\n            \"0x00FF49 THREAT DETECTED: NONE...\",\n            \"0x00FF4A UPDATING SECURITY PROTOCOLS...\"\n        ];\n\n        function addLog() {\n            const randomMessage = logMessages[Math.floor(Math.random() * logMessages.length)];\n            const logLine = document.createElement('div');\n            logLine.className = 'terminal-line';\n            \n            // Randomly add some special styling\n            if (randomMessage.includes(\"BYPASSED\") || randomMessage.includes(\"COMPLETE\") || randomMessage.includes(\"PASSED\")) {\n                logLine.classList.add('log-success');\n            } else if (randomMessage.includes(\"ERROR\") || randomMessage.includes(\"CRACK\")) {\n                logLine.classList.add('log-error');\n            } else if (randomMessage.includes(\"BYPASSING\") || randomMessage.includes(\"ATTEMPTING\")) {\n                logLine.classList.add('log-bypass');\n            }\n            \n            logLine.textContent = randomMessage;\n            terminal.appendChild(logLine);\n            \n            // Keep only last 20 lines\n            if (terminal.children.length > 20) {\n                terminal.removeChild(terminal.firstChild);\n            }\n            \n            // Auto scroll to bottom\n            terminal.scrollTop = terminal.scrollHeight;\n        }\n\n        // Update CPU/RAM values\n        function updateTelemetry() {\n            // CPU Core 1\n            const cpu1Value = Math.floor(Math.random() * 40) + 10; // 10-50%\n            const cpu1Bar = document.getElementById('cpu1-bar');\n            const cpu1Text = document.getElementById('cpu1');\n            cpu1Bar.style.width = cpu1Value + '%';\n            cpu1Text.textContent = cpu1Value + '%';\n            \n            // CPU Core 2\n            const cpu2Value = Math.floor(Math.random() * 50) + 15; // 15-65%\n            const cpu2Bar = document.getElementById('cpu2-bar');\n            const cpu2Text = document.getElementById('cpu2');\n            cpu2Bar.style.width = cpu2Value + '%';\n            cpu2Text.textContent = cpu2Value + '%';\n            \n            // RAM\n            const ramValue = Math.floor(Math.random() * 30) + 40; // 40-70%\n            const ramBar = document.getElementById('ram-bar');\n            const ramText = document.getElementById('ram');\n            ramBar.style.width = ramValue + '%';\n            ramText.textContent = ramValue + '%';\n            \n            // Temperature\n            const tempValue = Math.floor(Math.random() * 15) + 40; // 40-55\u00b0C\n            const tempText = document.getElementById('temp');\n            tempText.textContent = tempValue + '\u00b0C';\n        }\n\n        // Update network traffic\n        function updateNetwork() {\n            const trafficValue = Math.floor(Math.random() * 800) + 100; // 100-900 MB/s\n            const trafficBar = document.getElementById('traffic-bar');\n            const trafficText = document.getElementById('traffic-value');\n            \n            // Scale for visual bar (max 1000 MB/s for visual purposes)\n            const percentage = Math.min(trafficValue / 10, 100);\n            trafficBar.style.width = percentage + '%';\n            trafficText.textContent = trafficValue + ' MB/s';\n            \n            // Randomly activate nodes\n            const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('.node');\n            nodes.forEach(node => {\n                if (Math.random() > 0.7) {\n                    node.classList.toggle('active');\n                }\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Tab switching function\n        function switchTab(btn, tabName) {\n            // Remove active class from all buttons\n            document.querySelectorAll('.nav-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n            \n            // Add active class to clicked button\n            btn.classList.add('active');\n            \n            // Add visual feedback in terminal\n            const logLine = document.createElement('div');\n            logLine.className = 'terminal-line';\n            logLine.textContent = `SWITCHING TO ${tabName.toUpperCase()} MODULE...`;\n            terminal.appendChild(logLine);\n            terminal.scrollTop = terminal.scrollHeight;\n        }\n\n        // Initialize\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n            // Start terminal updates\n            setInterval(addLog, 1200);\n            \n            // Start telemetry updates\n            setInterval(updateTelemetry, 800);\n            \n            // Start network updates\n            setInterval(updateNetwork, 1000);\n            \n            // Initial logs\n            addLog();\n            addLog();\n            updateTelemetry();\n            updateNetwork();\n        });\n\n        // Glitch effect on hover for dashboard title\n        const dashboardTitle = document.querySelector('.dashboard-title');\n        dashboardTitle.addEventListener('mouseover', function() {\n            this.style.animationDuration = '0.2s';\n        });\n        dashboardTitle.addEventListener('mouseout', function() {\n            this.style.animationDuration = '4s';\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
